  "summary": "As a dedicated Full-Stack Developer with a Bachelor's degree in Computer Science from CSU, Sacramento, I bring a strong technical skill set with the ability to learn very quickly, whether if it is a computer language I have never worked with. I have a deep interests in web development and software development. I am highly committed to continue expanding my knowledge and learn more as the age of technology progresses.\n\nMy expertise lies in creating responsive interfaces with a robust backend functionalities, primarily using AngularJS, SQL, C# (.NET Framework), and HTML. Throughout my time at Health Financial Systems (HFS), I have honed my abilities in software development while interning and currently full time working at HFS. I believe that with clear communication, allows for a powerful team. I allocate my success to not only my technical skills, but the ability to create and work effectively in a diverse team setting.\n\nI take pride in my ability to translate complex technical challenges into user-friendly solutions. My hands-on experience is complemented by a strong academic background where I've delved into various programming languages and frameworks, emerging with a well-rounded understanding of the software development lifecycle.\n\nWhile I am currently focused on delivering projects with my present team, I am not actively seeking new roles. However, I am always eager to connect with fellow professionals who share the same passion for tech and innovation.",
